  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's Coyote Military Riggers Belt is U.S. military compliant according to DA PAM 670-1/AR 670-1. The tactical belt's coyote color meets the Army's new regulations and can be worn with your OCP Scorpion Uniform. The riggers belt is also available in additional colors.&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "1654",
  "description": "<p>Built to field-specs, our Active-Duty Riggers Belt is ideal for tactical and everyday wear. The Coyote Brown is designed to complement OCP Scorpion uniforms while the Black is a great versatile option for on and off duty use. Sizing as follows: X-Small = up to 27 inch &ndash; 32 inch waist / Small = up to 32 inch waist / Medium = up to 31 inch &ndash; 35 inch waist / Large = up to 35 inch &ndash; 39 inch waist / X-Large = 39 inch &ndash; 43 inch waist / 2X-Large = 43 inch &ndash; 47 inch waist.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
